UM,&PO_REVISION_NUM pour &FUNCTIONAL_CURRENCY &TOTAL_AMOUNT_DSP &REQUIRES_APPR\
OVAL_MSG&WRONG_FORWARD_TO_MSG\n\
&PO_APPROVE_MSG  <BR>\n\
\n\
&DKA_MSG_DESC_CONTRAT_CDE_SSTR <BR>\n\
<BR>\n\
\n\
